    "about_title": "🏛️ About 港大道 (HKU DAO)",
    "about_intro": "港大道 (HKU DAO) is a decentralized autonomous organization built on the RBAS blockchain, dedicated to preserving and celebrating the rich heritage of the University of Hong Kong.",
    "about_p1": "The University of Hong Kong (HKU), founded in 1911, is the oldest tertiary institution in Hong Kong. With over a century of excellence, HKU has shaped generations of leaders, thinkers, and innovators. 港大道 transforms HKU's legacy into a digital ecosystem where alumni, students, and enthusiasts can connect, trade, and co-create value through NFTs.",
    "about_p2": "Our mission is to bridge the past and the future by tokenizing HKU's cultural assets – from historic buildings and academic milestones to student memories and iconic symbols. Each NFT represents a unique piece of HKU's story, secured on the RBAS blockchain.",
    "key_features_title": "🔑 Key Features",
    "feature_1": "🏛️ Faculty & Department NFTs – Own a piece of HKU's academic heritage.",
    "feature_2": "🌆 Iconic Buildings & Landmarks – Collect NFTs of HKU's most beloved structures.",
    "feature_3": "📜 History by Year – Trace HKU's journey through milestone NFTs.",
    "feature_4": "🍜 Local Culture – From dim sum to hiking trails, explore HKU's vibrant community. Tourist Spots.",
    "feature_5": "💎 NFT Marketplace – Buy, sell, and trade HKU NFTs with the community.",
    "feature_6": "🔗 RBAS Blockchain – Secure, transparent, and authentic digital ownership.",
    "cta_text": "🚀 Join the movement! Explore the categories, collect NFTs, and become part of the HKU DAO community. Together, we build the future of heritage on the blockchain.",
